[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C12]
Las Pegasus-Rock Farm Reciprocity Agreement

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C12_desc]
The Western Equestria Trade Alliance has just been established, but we need more resources and markets, as well as a complete industrial structure, to compete with the Empire.\nTherefore, we need to seek cooperation with Rock Farm to obtain their manufacturing resources.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C12]
洛马基-采石农场互惠协议

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C12_desc]
西小马国贸易同盟初步建立，我们需要更多的资源和市场，以及完整的产业结构，才能和帝国分庭抗礼。\n因此，我们需要争取采石农场的合作，以获得他们的制造业资源。

